; spawnrise.eval - a freshly spawned skeleton holds its square while it gets up.
;
; The skeleton kit's Spawn clips (spawn__getting_up*, spawn__standing_up) run
; 9.5 to 14.3 s. The AI used to execute its orders under the held Spawn state,
; so the monster glided 14,9 -> 14,15 toward the party still lying down. A
; RISING monster now neither turns nor acts until the clip ends: `monsters`
; prints `rising Ns` while it holds, and the cell must stay 14,9 until that
; reads nothing, then advance.

logecho on
reset
timescale 0
lockstep on
seed 7

arena open 9 9
mapinfo
tp 14 16
face n
spawn skel_warrior 14 9 s

echo --- rising ---
monsters
step 1
monsters
step 3
monsters
step 3
monsters
step 2
monsters
step 2
monsters
step 2
monsters
step 2
echo --- up ---
monsters
step 2
monsters
step 2
monsters
step 2
monsters
